r of hearth and home. Originium has recorded and recreated her last waking moment before collapse. 'Espy the realm, every life seen; seek your sojourn path.'","abilities":["When defeated, the tile underneath becomes unavailable for deployment"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":9000,"atk":450,"def":1250,"res":60,"elementalRes":10,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":3}},"active_sarkaz_caster_crystal":{"slug":"active_sarkaz_caster_crystal","name":"Active Sarkaz Caster Crystal","icon":"/enemies-icons/Active Sarkaz Caster Crystal.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Originium Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Originating from an archived enemy. The Originium body of these Sarkaz casters allows them to use previously unknown forms of Arts to interfere with our deployment, significantly pressuring our defenses.","abilities":["Temporarily halts your DP regeneration shortly after it enters the battlefield"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":10000,"atk":600,"def":1200,"res":60,"elementalRes":10,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}},"mimic_machine":{"slug":"mimic_machine","name":"Mimic Machine","icon":"/enemies-icons/Mimic Machine.webp","rank":"Boss","race":"Originium Creation","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"PRTS has transformed familiar objects on Rhodes Island into material threats. These machines do not know fear.","abilities":["['Rebuild'] Until <PRTS, Source Code> is defeated, <Mimic Machine> recovers whenever it is defeated, increasing its ATK with each recovery, maxing out after 5 increases","[Write Restriction] Temporarily disables the 4 Operators with the highest DP in your Deployment Waiting Zone when it enters the battlefield; Becomes stronger after the first recovery, disabling more functions","[Heavy Ion Elastic Recoil]